    {
     "say": "Again you multiplied first (4 pens = \u00a312) then subtracted, giving \u00a38. That is <strong>BIDMAS</strong>: Brackets, Indices, Division and Multiplication, then Addition and Subtraction. The steps ahead just apply this rule to bigger calculations."
